    "detailed_description": "Carefully observe the abnormalities in the room.<br>If you do something that doesn't follow the correct steps,<br>you will be stuck in the loop of this dream forever.<br><br>This game will reflect the story of a salaried worker,<br>one who works hard, bears the burden of debt, and is constantly overwhelmed by stress,<br>leading to sleeping problems.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/a8275b3b924655d7d473c64d235eefb1.poster.avif?t=1716697369\" width=742 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/a8275b3b924655d7d473c64d235eefb1.webm?t=1716697369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/a8275b3b924655d7d473c64d235eefb1.mp4?t=1716697369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>You will play as this salaried worker living in an apartment room.<br>When you wake up, you must determine whether your room is in its original state or not.<br>Pay close attention to the objects inside the room.<br>Otherwise, you will have to start all over again from the beginning.<br><br>-----------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br>Somnium is a FPS horror spot the difference game<br>with simple gameplay mechanics where you must memorize<br>what your &quot;normal&quot; room looks like<br>and observe whether anything has changed within the room.<br><br>The first time, you will wake up before midnight,<br>and you must remember the state of your room.<br><br><br>When you go to bed, you will wake up again in the middle of the night,<br>and you must notice if your room is still the same as before.<br><br>If it remains unchanged, you need to go to the toilet and then return to sleep.<br>Failing to follow this procedure will send you back to the beginning at midnight.<br><br>However, if something in your room has changed or disappeared,<br>you should go back to bed without visiting the toilet.<br><br>If you enter the toilet when your room is not in its normal state,<br>you will also be sent back to start over at midnight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/19fc7dd00388b50ca123ebd2328a2d29.avif?t=1716697369\" width=535 height=288 /></span><br><br>To break free from this looping event, you must be observant and follow the steps correctly to advance the time until dawn.<br><br><strong><u>Oh, and also... if you wake up and find yourself not in your bed, you need to get back to your bed as soon as possible.</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/928433f82da10893496171586da58db6.poster.avif?t=1716697369\" width=742 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/928433f82da10893496171586da58db6.webm?t=1716697369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/928433f82da10893496171586da58db6.mp4?t=1716697369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>-----------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><strong>This game draws inspiration from the renowned puzzle game The Exit 8,</strong><br><strong>and has been lovingly crafted out of a profound passion for the puzzle genre.</strong><br><br>-----------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play time</strong></h2>10 - 60 minutes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game difficulty</strong></h2>If you make a mistake, you will start playing again from the beginning (midnight).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save function</strong></h2>The game will automatically save each time you sleep.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2>Mouse and keyboard, or Xbox controller<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics settings</strong></h2>If your computer experiences frame rate drops while playing, it is recommended to change the overall graphic settings to &quot;Low&quot;.",
