o the beginning at midnight.<br><br>However, if something in your room has changed or disappeared,<br>you should go back to bed without visiting the toilet.<br><br>If you enter the toilet when your room is not in its normal state,<br>you will also be sent back to start over at midnight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/19fc7dd00388b50ca123ebd2328a2d29.avif?t=1716697369\" width=535 height=288 /></span><br><br>To break free from this looping event, you must be observant and follow the steps correctly to advance the time until dawn.<br><br><strong><u>Oh, and also... if you wake up and find yourself not in your bed, you need to get back to your bed as soon as possible.</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/928433f82da10893496171586da58db6.poster.avif?t=1716697369\" width=742 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/928433f82da10893496171586da58db6.webm?t=1716697369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957140/extras/928433f82da10893496171586da58db6.mp4?t=1716697369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>-----------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><strong>This game draws inspiration from the renowned puzzle game The Exit 8,</strong><br><strong>and has been lovingly crafted out of a profound passion for the puzzle genre.</strong><br><br>-----------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play time</strong></h2>10 - 60 minutes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game difficulty</strong></h2>If you make a mistake, you will start playing again from the beginning (midnight).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save function</strong></h2>The game will automatically save each time you sleep.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2>Mouse and keyboard, or Xbox controller<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics settings</strong></h2>If your computer experiences frame rate drops while playing, it is recommended to change the overall graphic settings to &quot;Low&quot;.",
